        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "56: the people, a people \n\nthe people指人a peopk指民族.The Chinese is apeace-loving peopk.\n57. it,one \n\n同一物体，one同类不同一 lost my pen.Ihave tobu anew one.\n58. that, thus \n\nthat指代上文所提到的，this导下文所要说的.\nI was in,That's why.\n\n59. none, nothing ,no one \n\nnone强调有少，wothing，ho ome强调有没有，nothing指物，no one指人.\n—How many…How much…?-none \nbo. anyone, any one \n\nany one 指人，不能接of；any one指人、物均可，可接of.any one of you.\nb1. who, what \n\nWho指姓名或关系，what指职业或地位.\n\nWhat is your dad? He is a tacher.\n\n62. what,which \n\nWhat 的选择基础是无限制的，which在一定范围内进行选择.\nwhich do you prefer, bananas or apples?\n63.other,another \n\nother后接名词复数，another后接名词单数other students，anher stuent.\nb4. not a little, not a bit.\n\nnot a litte 非常，not a bit一点也不.\n\nI'm not a bit tired.我一点儿也不累.\n\n65. many, much, a lot of \n\nmany和可数名词连用，much和不可数名词连用，a lot of可数.\n但不用于否定句：I haven't many books.\n\n",
